## Overfitting guards

The verdict above compares Sharpe ratios; it does not know how many strategies were tried before
these were picked. The Deflated Sharpe Ratio (DSR) in each table corrects one strategy for that
search, and the Probability of Backtest Overfitting (PBO) below judges the whole set. They are
reported alongside the verdict and do not change it. Sharpe ratios are per period, not annualised.
